---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const CORRECTIONS_EMAIL = 'someone@knowware.vc';
---
<Base title="Corrections and removal" description="How to report an error, or ask for a change to how a person appears in Knowware.">
  <section class="kw-section">
    <p class="kw-label">Corrections</p>
    <h1 class="kw-h2">Report an error. Ask for a change.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="kw-section rules-body" style="max-width: 680px">
    <p class="kw-body">
      The 81 voices in Knowware are texts written for the book from each person's published work.
      They are not interviews. The people did not say or review them, and they do not endorse the book.
      Biographical details are summarized from public sources and can be wrong or out of date.
    </p>
    <h2 class="kw-h3" style="margin-top:32px">If you are named here, or act for someone who is</h2>
    <p class="kw-body">
      Write to <a href={`mailto:${CORRECTIONS_EMAIL}`}>{CORRECTIONS_EMAIL}</a>. You can ask us to correct a fact,
      change or remove the synthesized text, or remove a name entirely. Please include the page address,
      the sentence in question, what is wrong, and what you would like done. If you write for someone else,
      tell us who you are so we can confirm before we act.
    </p>
    <!-- COUNSEL: confirm the timing commitments below before relying on them. -->
    <p class="kw-body">
      We will acknowledge your message within three business days and tell you what we have done or will do
      within ten.
    </p>
    <h2 class="kw-h3" style="margin-top:32px">Everyone else</h2>
    <p class="kw-body">
      Readers can report errors at the same address. We correct factual errors as soon as we can verify them.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
